<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT ARGENTINA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT ARGENTINA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia beat Argentina 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a South American World Cup qualifier on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bolivia - Marco Sandy (8), Fernando Ochoazipur (49)</p>
<p>Argentina - Nestor Gorosito (42, penalty)</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
